# Generated artifacts
#
# model.pkl + scaler.pkl ARE committed on purpose. app.py loads them at
# startup, so ignoring them means a fresh clone cannot boot without first
# running train_model.py (~135 s, plus regenerating a 26k-position dataset).
# At 3.4 MB they cost nothing and make the repo run-and-playable.
#
# Everything below is genuinely regenerable and is left out to keep the tree
# readable: build_report.py and make_figures.py reproduce all of it.
positions_dataset.csv
report.html
report.pdf
report_top.png
